    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Description:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a wondrous world where magic intertwines with the lives of extraordinary creatures and people, many legends have been passed down through the ages. One such legend spoke of a magical stone capable of granting any wish of its holder. This stone, imbued with ancient power, was guarded by a goddess whose location remained hidden from prying eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was said that the path to the coveted artifact was long and dangerous, for the key to uncovering its location was protected by fearless warrior maidens. Each of them possessed remarkable strength and would never give away their secrets to a stranger. Many brave souls had attempted the journey, but their fates were shrouded in darkness \u2014 no one ever heard from those who dared to challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478010/extras/b5b1fafd0f42dd579cd51797debeb624.poster.avif?t=1740661509\" width=610 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478010/extras/b5b1fafd0f42dd579cd51797debeb624.webm?t=1740661509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478010/extras/b5b1fafd0f42dd579cd51797debeb624.mp4?t=1740661509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one day, a new hero appeared. His name was Toshi, and he was determined to test his strength. Toshi had rare courage and an unyielding will, and his goal was as ambitious as it was dangerous \u2014 immortality and domination over the entire magical world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thus began his fateful odyssey. Resolute and ready for any challenge, he took his first step toward the adventures that would change his life and, perhaps, the entire world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478010/extras/e1751888584d748705b79b873d9f9462.poster.avif?t=1740661509\" width=610 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478010/extras/e1751888584d748705b79b873d9f9462.webm?t=1740661509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478010/extras/e1751888584d748705b79b873d9f9462.mp4?t=1740661509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines elements of the \u201cmatch-3\u201d genre and visual novel storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To unlock more details about the characters, you must defeat them in battles that are based on the \u201cmatch-3\u201d system and are influenced by the heroines\u2019 attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory requires not only creating chains of stones but also strategically using abilities and items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478010/extras/45bb3f6153cef066f83c007d256edc47.poster.avif?t=1740661509\" width=610 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478010/extras/45bb3f6153cef066f83c007d256edc47.webm?t=1740661509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478010/extras/45bb3f6153cef066f83c007d256edc47.mp4?t=1740661509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will determine the future of these girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
