ook his first step toward the adventures that would change his life and, perhaps, the entire world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478010/extras/e1751888584d748705b79b873d9f9462.poster.avif?t=1740661509\" width=610 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478010/extras/e1751888584d748705b79b873d9f9462.webm?t=1740661509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478010/extras/e1751888584d748705b79b873d9f9462.mp4?t=1740661509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines elements of the \u201cmatch-3\u201d genre and visual novel storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To unlock more details about the characters, you must defeat them in battles that are based on the \u201cmatch-3\u201d system and are influenced by the heroines\u2019 attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory requires not only creating chains of stones but also strategically using abilities and items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478010/extras/45bb3f6153cef066f83c007d256edc47.poster.avif?t=1740661509\" width=610 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478010/extras/45bb3f6153cef066f83c007d256edc47.webm?t=1740661509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478010/extras/45bb3f6153cef066f83c007d256edc47.mp4?t=1740661509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will determine the future of these girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
